          "sourceRegion": "Question 10 shared square grid",
          "description": "Two unshaded triangles on a shared 10-column, 6-row square grid, preserving the common baseline, equal heights and differing base widths. The mathematical triangle outlines prevent use of a blank-grid template.",
          "mathematics": "Measured from the lower-left grid corner: X has vertices (1,1), (3,1), (2,5); Y has vertices (5,1), (9,1), (7,5). Bases are 2 and 4 grid units; both heights are 4 grid units.",
